OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and scattered
OL,6,Fshowers across the north on Saturday
OL,7,Fwith brisk winds. A drier day further
OL,8,Fsouth with plenty of sunny spells,
OL,9,Falthough feeling fresher than recent
OL,10,Fdays.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWindy in the northwest
OL,13,Fovernight with further showery
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain. Drier elsewhere
OL,15,Fwith clear spells and a few mist and
OL,16,Ffog patches. Chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
